cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this formalization, please cite it as below."
title: "Coq-BBB4: a machine-checked formalization of Beeping Busy Beaver BBB(4)"
authors:
  - family-names: "Carrino"
    given-names: "John"
repository-code: "https://github.com/carrino/Coq-BBB4"
license: ISC
abstract: >-
  Kernel-checked Coq proofs (Coq 8.18, axiom footprint
  functional_extensionality_dep only) that BBB(4) = 32,779,478 in the
  state-level quasihalting convention: every 4-state 2-symbol Turing
  machine either quasihalts with score at most 32,779,478 or never
  quasihalts, and the champion 1RB1LD_1RC1RB_1LC1LA_0RC0RD attains the
  bound exactly.  Built from the certificates of the BBB harness on the
  patterns of Coq-BB5 and busycoq.
keywords:
  - busy beaver
  - beeping busy beaver
  - quasihalting
  - Turing machines
  - Coq
  - formal verification
